data: {"id": "29219317786a4bdc-final", "run_id": "29219317786a4bdc", "seq": 728, "ts_ms": 1789114637009, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v03/workload` | Pending | Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 处于 `Pending` 状态，`node: <none>`。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (default-scheduler) | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found` (fact-8de74f530b71) | 直接指出调度失败的元凶是缺少 PVC `unavailable-claim`，且 3 个节点均无抢占受害者 (fact-8de74f530b71) |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (Pod Status) | `Pending` 状态 (fact-5791f563b0ca) | 确认 Pod 处于无法调度的停滞状态 (fact-5791f563b0ca) |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes (Resource Requests/Limits) | CPU Request `5m`, Limit `50m`；Memory Request `8Mi`, Limit `32Mi` (fact-6e7d38b9bf40, fact-8fe213608ad3) | 证明资源请求极小，排除集群整体资源耗尽或由于 Pod 资源需求过大导致的调度过晚 (fact-6e7d38b9bf40, fact-8fe213608ad3) |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1` (fact-d722dba44f3a) | 独立度量确认了 Pod 的 Pending 状态 (fact-d722dba44f3a) |\n| 5 | 工具调用 | kubectl | `kubectl describe pvc unavailable-claim -n aiops-case-v03` 返回 `Error from server (NotFound): persistentvolumeclaims \"unavailable-claim\" not found` (failed_tool_attempts) | 独立证实了该 PVC 在集群中确实不存在 (failed_tool_attempts) |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes Event 直接揭示了 `FailedScheduling` 的机制是 PVC `unavailable-claim` 缺失。资源配置证据排除了资源不足导致调度过晚的可能性。Metrics 与 Pod 状态的直接确认相互印证。工具调用的失败结果独立证实了 Event 中提到的缺失资源。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 定义中引用了不存在的 PVC `unavailable-claim` → default-scheduler 调度检查发现 PVC 缺失并无法满足持久化卷挂载条件 → 调度器抛出 `FailedScheduling` 事件且无抢占方案 → Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 的 Volume 配置错误引用了不存在的 `PersistentVolumeClaim` (`unavailable-claim`)**。\n\n调度器在尝试将 Pod 调度到节点时，检测到依赖的 PVC 不存在，导致调度失败 (`FailedScheduling`)。由于集群中没有满足抢占条件的节点（\"3 No preemption victims found\"），该问题持续存在，使得 Pod 无法启动。证据 (fact-8de74f530b71) 和工具调用 (failed_tool_attempts) 一致证实了这一点。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 27.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v03/workload: 27.9s (Evidence 20.6s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v03/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 61.081, "metrics": {"run_id": "29219317786a4bdc", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 61.088128089904785, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 61088.128089904785, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 57398.22793006897, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7405.316352844238, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3366.511106491089}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22452.253818511963, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 27892.027378082275, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10721.93717956543, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

